	"Description": "[Dyeable Wedding Dress](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8864)  converted to a Fashion Sense pack\nRecycle your wedding dress at every occasion! The way your great great grandma used to.\n\n_Quick Start_\n\n1.  Unzip this mod and it's required mods into your mods folder, if you are confused see [this guide](https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Player_Guide/Getting_Started#Getting_started)\n\n2.  It's ready to play!\n\n3.  Buy the hand mirror from Pierre's shop, or select \"start with hand mirror\" when creating a new farm\n\n4.  Select the hand mirror tool and then click anywhere on your screen\n\n_Credits_\nThe spotty top and dress are inspired by the dress Maru wears in [Diverse Stardew Valley](https://www.moddrop.com/stardew-valley/mods/1073356-diverse-stardew-valley-sebastian-maru-robin-and-demetrius-dsv-seasonal-outfits)  as designed by DesertDove. I have permissions! And I have much love for Wabi, for helping me with the formatting of this mod.",
